          "settings": {
            "text_1": "How do I find my right size?",
            "copy_2": "Every product page has a garment-specific size guide with actual bust, waist, and length measurements. If you are between sizes, WhatsApp us a quick note with your measurements and we will recommend the best fit from the current batch."
